  _descriptionText: "Top-down dungeon crawler game about a computer virus trying
    to corrupt the system.\n\n- You play as the virus which is trying to find the
    windows root folder while the minions of the Malware-bites antivirus constantly
    try to keep you away. \n\n- You have a limited time period to complete your mission,
    and instead of health, you lose time whenever you get hit. "
